{"n":94,"name":"Ash-Sharh","meaning":"The Expansion","ayahs":8,"startPage":596,"verses":[{"i":1,"ar":"أَلَمۡ نَشۡرَحۡ لَكَ صَدۡرَكَ","tr":"Alam nashrah laka sadraka","en":"Did We not expand for you, [O Muhammad], your breast"},{"i":2,"ar":"وَوَضَعۡنَا عَنكَ وِزۡرَكَ","tr":"WawadaAAna AAanka wizraka","en":"And We removed from you your burden"},{"i":3,"ar":"ٱلَّذِيٓ أَنقَضَ ظَهۡرَكَ","tr":"Allathee anqada thahraka","en":"Which had weighed upon your back"},{"i":4,"ar":"وَرَفَعۡنَا لَكَ ذِكۡرَكَ","tr":"WarafaAAna laka thikraka","en":"And raised high for you your repute"},{"i":5,"ar":"فَإِنَّ مَعَ ٱلۡعُسۡرِ يُسۡرًا","tr":"Fainna maAAa alAAusri yusran","en":"For indeed, with hardship [will be] ease"},{"i":6,"ar":"إِنَّ مَعَ ٱلۡعُسۡرِ يُسۡرٗا","tr":"Inna maAAa alAAusri yusran","en":"Indeed, with hardship [will be] ease"},{"i":7,"ar":"فَإِذَا فَرَغۡتَ فَٱنصَبۡ","tr":"Faitha faraghta fainsab","en":"So when you have finished [your duties], then stand up [for worship]"},{"i":8,"ar":"وَإِلَىٰ رَبِّكَ فَٱرۡغَب","tr":"Waila rabbika fairghab","en":"And to your Lord direct [your] longing"}]}